 Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/accessibilityAction(action:label:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/accessibilityAction(action:label:)","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityAction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Label","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"action","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"label","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Label","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"role":"symbol","title":"accessibilityAction(action:label:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/accessibilityaction(action:label:)","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview","title":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a shape. A magnification (pinch) gesture drives an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state feeds the shape’s Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"); releasing the pinch “pops” the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch to its nearest state with a spring. At rest a white triangle sits at its base scale on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the magenta artboard."}],"type":"topic"}}}